OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cool, dry and clear start
OL,6,Facross the region. Cloud builds at
OL,7,Ftimes through the day but remaining
OL,8,Fdry with light winds for all.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining partly cloudy and
OL,12,Fdry into the evening. A cool night
OL,13,Ffollows with cloud building from the
OL,14,Fwest overnight. Patchy rain arrives by
OL,15,Fdawn with winds freshening later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FCloudy and damp through the
OL,18,Fmorning with light rain across the
OL,19,Fregion. Rain becoming patchy through
OL,20,Fthe afternoon. Fresh winds.
OL,21,FTemperatures above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
